  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ConocoPhillips Transportation Alaska, Inc. (Company) is subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC). The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements generally conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Page 700 Not included with This Submission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Page 700 is not included with this report as it is not required. Pipelines compromising the Trans-Alaska Pipeline System (TAPS) and any pipeline delivering oil directly to or indirectly into the TAPS are excluded from Page 700 reporting requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
